      },
      {
       "text": "$48\\sqrt{3}$",
       "correct": false
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Since $\\sqrt{48}=\\sqrt{16\\times3}=4\\sqrt{3}$, multiplying by 3 gives $3\\times4\\sqrt{3}=12\\sqrt{3}$."
