       "correct": false
      },
      {
       "text": "$23-8\\sqrt{7}$",
       "correct": true
      }
     ],
     "explanation": "Using $(a-b)^2=a^2-2ab+b^2$, we get $16-8\\sqrt{7}+7=23-8\\sqrt{7}$."
